Description: Proxmox VE and Backup Server monitor for KDE Plasma
 ProxMon is a Plasma 6 widget that shows the state of Proxmox VE nodes,
 virtual machines and containers, and of Proxmox Backup Server, in a
 panel or on the desktop.
 .
 It can open a VNC console to a virtual machine and a terminal to an LXC
 container. API tokens are stored in KWallet, or in KeePassXC through the
 Secret Service.
